    "title": "Lip Reader Reveals Vanessa Trump's 'Immature' Remark To Tiger Woods",
    "text": "Tiger Woods and Vanessa Trump have officially been dating for more than a year.The 15-time major champion and the ex-wife of Donald Trump Jr. have been going strong for more than 12 months. Woods and Trump officially announced their relationship on social media last year.\"Love is in the air and life is better with you by my side! We look forward to our journey through life together. At this time we would appreciate privacy for all those close to our hearts,\" they announced last March.The relationship started in Florida, where Tiger and Vanessa's children attend the same private school.The couple has attended several notable events together, too, including some recent golf tournaments.During one recent photoshoot at a golf tournament, Vanessa Trump admitted to making an \"immature\" comment about her appearance.Lip reader details the conversationA lip reader revealed what Vanessa Trump was saying to Tiger Woods.Woods and Trump were posing in front of a statue at the Genesis Invitational. Vanessa Trump expressed annoyance in the wind, as she believed it was messing with her hair. She wanted to try some different poses and different locations for the photoshoot.Ultimately, she realized she was being immature.\"It's alright,\" as she confessed per the lip reader, \"I know...I need to stop being immature.\"Tiger Woods responded: \"I don't even have any hair.\"The couple seemed to have a good time posing for photos at the golf tournament, at least.This story was originally published by The Spun on Mar 8, 2026, where it first appeared in the Golf section. Add The Spun as a Preferred Source by clicking here.",
